{
  "_meta": {
    "stage": "50-narration",
    "by": "示例",
    "at": "2026-10-14T07:00:00+08:00",
    "content_hash": "c0fa494812759e01ba661b11c4882c66981b98c17d0962dc95b9d87aba675f8a"
  },
  "narration": [
    {
      "card": 1,
      "lines": [
        {
          "who": "narrator",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "叮咚！小满早上好，今天是世界各地日。",
          "emotion": "开心",
          "sfx": "chime"
        },
        {
          "who": "dog",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "哈——欠……我昨晚睡得可香了。",
          "emotion": "困倦"
        },
        {
          "who": "owl",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "团子狗，看看封面，这张照片会让你睡不着。",
          "emotion": "神秘"
        },
        {
          "who": "narrator",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "这是挪威最北边的北角，海面金灿灿的，太阳挂在天边。"
        },
        {
          "who": "narrator",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "照片上写着拍摄时间：零点四十四分。",
          "emotion": "惊讶"
        },
        {
          "who": "dog",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "半夜十二点多？太阳怎么还不下班！",
          "emotion": "惊讶"
        },
        {
          "who": "narrator",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "你觉得是为什么？先暂停猜一猜，答案在下一页。",
          "emotion": "温柔",
          "pause": 5,
          "hold": "⏸ 先猜一猜，答案在下一页"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "card": 2,
      "lines": [
        {
          "who": "narrator",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "答案揭晓时间！咕咕博士，太阳为什么不下班？",
          "emotion": "开心"
        },
        {
          "who": "owl",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "秘密就一句话：地球是歪着身子转的。"
        },
        {
          "who": "dog",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "歪着转？那不会晕吗？",
          "emotion": "惊讶"
        },
        {
          "who": "owl",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "你玩过陀螺吧？转起来常常是斜的，地球也一样。",
          "emotion": "温柔"
        },
        {
          "who": "owl",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "它歪了二十三点五度。",
          "rate": "slow"
        },
        {
          "who": "dog",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "就歪这么一点点，有什么关系？"
        },
        {
          "who": "owl",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "看图。夏天，地球的北边正好歪向太阳。"
        },
        {
          "who": "owl",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "黄色这一圈叫北极圈。地球转一整圈，它都照得到太阳。"
        },
        {
          "who": "mouse",
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "So the sun never goes to bed!",
          "emotion": "开心"
        },
        {
          "who": "dog",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "北角就在圈里面？所以半夜太阳也不落山！",
          "emotion": "兴奋"
        },
        {
          "who": "owl",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "对。那里夏天有七十六天，太阳一直不落。"
        },
        {
          "who": "dog",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "那冬天呢？",
          "emotion": "委屈"
        },
        {
          "who": "owl",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "冬天正好反过来：北边背着太阳，整天黑乎乎的。"
        },
        {
          "who": "narrator",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "冷知识：斯瓦尔巴群岛不许养猫，怕猫伤害北极的鸟。",
          "emotion": "神秘"
        },
        {
          "who": "dog",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "听说那里的北极熊，比人还多！",
          "emotion": "惊讶"
        },
        {
          "who": "narrator",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "你也可以试试：拿手电筒当太阳，歪着转一个橙子。",
          "emotion": "温柔"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "card": 3,
      "lines": [
        {
          "who": "narrator",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "弄懂了太阳的秘密，我们来看看今天的单词屋！",
          "emotion": "开心"
        },
        {
          "who": "mouse",
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Pack your bags! Today we go to Norway!",
          "emotion": "兴奋"
        },
        {
          "who": "dog",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "我只听懂了“挪威”……",
          "emotion": "委屈"
        },
        {
          "who": "mouse",
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "midnight",
          "repeat": 2
        },
        {
          "who": "narrator",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "午夜，半夜十二点。mid 是中间，night 是夜晚。"
        },
        {
          "who": "mouse",
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "In Norway, the sun is still up at midnight in summer.",
          "rate": "slow"
        },
        {
          "who": "mouse",
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "circle",
          "repeat": 2
        },
        {
          "who": "narrator",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "圆圈。上一期学过，还记得吗？"
        },
        {
          "who": "mouse",
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "The sun moves in a circle and never goes down.",
          "rate": "slow"
        },
        {
          "who": "mouse",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第三个，新词哦！",
          "emotion": "兴奋"
        },
        {
          "who": "mouse",
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "curtain",
          "repeat": 2
        },
        {
          "who": "dog",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "窗帘！半夜太亮，睡觉得拉上厚窗帘。"
        },
        {
          "who": "mouse",
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "People close the curtains because it is too bright.",
          "rate": "slow",
          "pause": 3,
          "hold": "🗣 跟着读"
        },
        {
          "who": "narrator",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "轮到你啦：用 because 把两句话合成一句，写在格子里。",
          "emotion": "温柔"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "card": 4,
      "lines": [
        {
          "who": "narrator",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "单词学会了，小剧场开演！第三集：珍珠的真相。",
          "emotion": "神秘"
        },
        {
          "who": "narrator",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "一大早，阳光照进阁楼。桌上四个空杯子，谁也不说话。",
          "emotion": "紧张"
        },
        {
          "who": "raccoon",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "干嘛都看着我？窗户开着，说不定是外面的人爬进来的！",
          "emotion": "得意"
        },
        {
          "who": "narrator",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "咕咕博士推推眼镜，走到窗边。",
          "sfx": "footsteps"
        },
        {
          "who": "owl",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "窗台上没有脚印，窗外的泥地上也没有。"
        },
        {
          "who": "owl",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "真有人爬进来，一定会留下痕迹。"
        },
        {
          "who": "mouse",
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Look! A pearl!",
          "emotion": "惊讶"
        },
        {
          "who": "narrator",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "一颗珍珠，正粘在团子狗的尾巴尖上！",
          "emotion": "惊讶",
          "sfx": "drum"
        },
        {
          "who": "dog",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "我？我一直睡在沙发上啊……",
          "emotion": "委屈"
        },
        {
          "who": "owl",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "门是从里面锁上的。",
          "rate": "slow"
        },
        {
          "who": "owl",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "只有本来就在屋里的，才喝得到奶茶。",
          "rate": "slow"
        },
        {
          "who": "narrator",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "大家一起喊：是你梦游啦！",
          "emotion": "兴奋"
        },
        {
          "who": "dog",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "嘿嘿……我梦见喝奶茶，原来是真喝了。",
          "emotion": "委屈"
        },
        {
          "who": "narrator",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "浣熊又买了四杯奶茶，每杯都写上了名字。"
        },
        {
          "who": "narrator",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "可是到了半夜，阁楼里又传来：吸溜，吸溜……",
          "emotion": "神秘",
          "sfx": "slurp",
          "pause": 1.5
        },
        {
          "who": "raccoon",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "这次可不是我！",
          "emotion": "委屈"
        },
        {
          "who": "narrator",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "侦探笔记：哪条线索证明，不是有人从窗户爬进来的？",
          "pause": 5,
          "hold": "🔍 回头找一找线索"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "card": 5,
      "lines": [
        {
          "who": "narrator",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "奶茶案破了，捣蛋浣熊又来出难题啦！",
          "emotion": "紧张"
        },
        {
          "who": "raccoon",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "哼，奶茶的事还没完！想过我这关？",
          "emotion": "得意"
        },
        {
          "who": "narrator",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "四位小客人排队领奶茶：艾莎、健太、卢卡和阿米尔。"
        },
        {
          "who": "narrator",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "线索一：艾莎不在第一个，也不在最后一个。",
          "pause": 1.5
        },
        {
          "who": "raccoon",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "线索二：健太紧跟在阿米尔后面。",
          "pause": 1.5
        },
        {
          "who": "narrator",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "线索三：卢卡是最后一个。",
          "pause": 1.5
        },
        {
          "who": "owl",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "小提示：先把最确定的那个人放好。",
          "emotion": "温柔",
          "pause": 5,
          "hold": "✏️ 写下你的答案"
        },
        {
          "who": "mouse",
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Level one. Midnight or noon? Fill in the blank."
        },
        {
          "who": "narrator",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第一关，两个词里选一个。"
        },
        {
          "who": "mouse",
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Level two. Why do they close the curtains?"
        },
        {
          "who": "narrator",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第二关，答案藏在小短文里。"
        },
        {
          "who": "mouse",
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Level three. Would you like to see the midnight sun?"
        },
        {
          "who": "narrator",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第三关，写两句，记得用上 because。",
          "emotion": "温柔"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "card": 6,
      "lines": [
        {
          "who": "narrator",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "做完挑战，来看环球小报！第一条，来自英国伦敦。",
          "emotion": "开心"
        },
        {
          "who": "narrator",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "十一岁的 Bodhana 拿到女子特级大师称号，破了纪录！"
        },
        {
          "who": "dog",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "十一岁！她是怎么学的？",
          "emotion": "惊讶"
        },
        {
          "who": "narrator",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "她二零二零年才开始学棋，老师是网上的视频。"
        },
        {
          "who": "mouse",
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "record"
        },
        {
          "who": "narrator",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "如果是你，想打破什么纪录？",
          "emotion": "温柔"
        },
        {
          "who": "narrator",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第二条，美国佛罗里达：实验室的门被敲响了。",
          "sfx": "door"
        },
        {
          "who": "owl",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "门外是一只鹈鹕，翅膀上扎着鱼钩。"
        },
        {
          "who": "owl",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "科学家花了十分钟取下鱼钩，它就飞走了。"
        },
        {
          "who": "mouse",
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "help"
        },
        {
          "who": "narrator",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第三条，奥地利维也纳：狗狗分得清人脸上的害怕和生气。"
        },
        {
          "who": "dog",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "我就知道！我能看出你什么时候害怕！",
          "emotion": "得意"
        },
        {
          "who": "mouse",
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "face"
        },
        {
          "who": "narrator",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "你怎么看？鹈鹕为什么会去敲人类的门？",
          "pause": 3
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "card": 7,
      "lines": [
        {
          "who": "narrator",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "新闻看完，来检查一条说法。"
        },
        {
          "who": "dog",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "极昼时，太阳一直停在原地？"
        },
        {
          "who": "owl",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "你先想想，要怎么验证？"
        },
        {
          "who": "narrator",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "先看连续拍摄的极昼视频。"
        },
        {
          "who": "owl",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "比较太阳和地平线的位置。"
        },
        {
          "who": "raccoon",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "再找另一个地方的视频看看！"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "card": 8,
      "lines": [
        {
          "who": "narrator",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "查完线索，跟爱丽丝去冒险吧。"
        },
        {
          "who": "dog",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "咦，兔子怎么还穿着背心？"
        },
        {
          "who": "narrator",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "爱丽丝坐在姐姐身边，有点无聊。"
        },
        {
          "who": "owl",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "一只白兔突然跑过她的身边。"
        },
        {
          "who": "mouse",
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Oh dear! Oh dear! I shall be late!"
        },
        {
          "who": "dog",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "它竟然会说话！"
        },
        {
          "who": "narrator",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "它还从口袋里掏出一块怀表。"
        },
        {
          "who": "owl",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "爱丽丝追着白兔，跑进树篱下的大洞。"
        },
        {
          "who": "narrator",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "洞道先向前延伸，忽然直直向下。"
        },
        {
          "who": "dog",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "她来不及停住，掉下去了！"
        },
        {
          "who": "narrator",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "猜一猜，洞底会有什么？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "card": 9,
      "lines": [
        {
          "who": "narrator",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "最后一页，来拆今天的信箱！",
          "emotion": "开心"
        },
        {
          "who": "owl",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "小满，先公布上期答案：金字塔搭六层剩九块，搭七层还差四十块。",
          "emotion": "温柔",
          "sfx": "ding"
        },
        {
          "who": "dog",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "我要爆料！我梦见喝奶茶，醒来枕边真有根吸管！",
          "emotion": "兴奋"
        },
        {
          "who": "dog",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "小满，梦游的人，记得自己做过什么吗？",
          "emotion": "委屈"
        },
        {
          "who": "narrator",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "开放题：在挪威过没有黑夜的夏天，你最想做什么？",
          "pause": 3
        },
        {
          "who": "narrator",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "最喜欢哪一页、今天想到什么问题，记得说给妈妈听！",
          "emotion": "温柔"
        },
        {
          "who": "owl",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "明天是数学日，我们去看看蜜蜂的六边形小房子。",
          "emotion": "神秘"
        },
        {
          "who": "mouse",
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "See you tomorrow, Xiaoman!",
          "emotion": "开心"
        },
        {
          "who": "dog",
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "拜拜！我去补觉了……",
          "emotion": "困倦"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
